---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
import CaptureForm from "../../components/forms/capture-form.astro";

const seo = {
  page_description: "Comparing Cara Care and IBS-Go. Find out which gut health tracker is best for managing your low-FODMAP diet and identifying symptom triggers.",
  canonical_url: "/compare/cara-care-alternative/",
  open_graph_type: "website",
};
---

<Layout title="Cara Care Alternative | IBS-Go" seo={seo}>
  <main class="container-narrow py-16 prose prose-lg">
    <h1>IBS-Go vs. Cara Care</h1>
    <p class="lead">Cara Care is a beautiful, medicalized app for overall GI issues. IBS-Go is laser-focused on solving the FODMAP puzzle.</p>

    <h2>Where Cara Care Excels</h2>
    <p>Cara Care is fantastic for general digestive health tracking. It covers a wide range of metrics, including mood, skin, and sleep, making it great for holistic health overviews. However, for users specifically trying to navigate the complexities of the low-FODMAP elimination diet, it can feel too broad.</p>

    <h2>The IBS-Go Difference</h2>
    <p>IBS-Go is built specifically for the FODMAP protocol. If you eat 1/4 cup of sweet potato and a handful of blackberries, Cara Care logs the food. IBS-Go logs the food, calculates that you just stacked Mannitol and Sorbitol, and warns you of a potential flare-up in 24 hours.</p>

    <table class="w-full text-left">
      <thead>
        <tr><th>Feature</th><th>IBS-Go</th><th>Cara Care</th></tr>
      </thead>
      <tbody>
        <tr><td>Focus</td><td>Strict Low-FODMAP Analysis</td><td>Holistic GI & Mood Tracking</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Stacking Alerts</td><td class="text-green-600">Yes</td><td class="text-red-600">No</td></tr>
        <tr><td>Data Input Speed</td><td class="text-green-600">Rapid (FODMAP focused)</td><td class="text-orange-600">Slower (Many variables)</td></tr>
      </tbody>
    </table>

    <div class="not-prose bg-[var(--color-primary-50)] p-8 rounded-lg mt-12 border border-[var(--color-primary-200)]">
      <h3 class="text-xl font-bold mb-4">Focus on what triggers you.</h3>
      <CaptureForm form="waitlist" submitLabel="Get IBS-Go" />
    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>
